# Normalize line endings on checkin. Snapshot tests compare multi-line report output, and a
# CRLF checkout on the Windows CI runner would fail them for reasons that have nothing to do
# with the code. See .vault/OPEN_QUESTIONS.md Q-006.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts must keep LF even on Windows checkouts — a CRLF shebang line is not executable.
*.sh text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.svg text
